{"unit_id":"tag:0GF2:proof","translation":"完全如引理<REF_0001>的证明，我们断言一个拟逆（quasi-inverse）由函子（functor）给出，它将<MATH_0001>送到<MATH_0002>，要证明这一点，只需说明<MATH_0003>为同构（isomorphism）。这可局部检查，因此可以且确实假定<MATH_0004>仿射（affine）。于是能找到有限（finite）满射（surjective）态射（morphism）<MATH_0005>，使得存在开覆盖（covering）<MATH_0006>，使<MATH_0007>经<MATH_0008>分解。见态射（Morphisms）进阶引理<REF_0002>。应用引理<REF_0003>，可见只需在将<MATH_0009>替换为<MATH_0010>，将<MATH_0011>和<MATH_0012>替换为其基变换（base change）后证明引理。故可假定<MATH_0013>在 Zariski 局部有截面（sections）。当然，利用问题在<MATH_0014>上是局部的，归约到存在截面（section）的情形，即引理<REF_0004>。\n","allowed_english":["Zariski"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"开覆盖"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"quasi-inverse","target_term":"拟逆","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"isomorphism","target_term":"同构","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"affine","target_term":"仿射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"开覆盖","context":"开覆盖中的 covering；词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"词表尚未批准"},{"source_term":"section","target_term":"截面","context":"词表尚未批准"}],"notes":[]}
